# Route: guide 47 of 53 of the simulator's completionist route for NightElf
# (1445 of 1459 eligible quests, 164.6 h, world baeac23fbe5e): levels 59 to
# 60, 41 quests, 3.0 h under the model. The order is the simulator's (`sim run
# --objective completionist`, then `sim export`; docs/SIMULATION.md §10): fix
# a step in the exporter or the data, not only here, so the next export keeps
# it.
#
# Flow (Stonetalon Mountains, Teldrassil, Duskwood, Western Plaguelands,
# Tirisfal Glades, Durotar): Stonetalon Peak -> Webwinder Path -> Windshear
# Crag -> Webwinder Path -> Windshear Crag -> Sun Rock Retreat -> Webwinder
# Path -> The Charred Vale -> Webwinder Path -> Windshear Crag -> Webwinder
# Path -> Windshear Crag -> The Charred Vale -> ….
#
# Left to other guides: class quests (the Class category); dungeon quests (the
# Dungeons guides): Vyletongue Corruption (7041), Corruption of Earth and Seed
# (7065), In Search of Thaelrid (1198), Twilight Falls (1199), Crime and
# Punishment (377), Crime and Punishment (377), Barov Family Fortune (5343),
# Doctor Theolen Krastinov, the Butcher (5382), Kirtonos the Herald (5384),
# The Lich, Ras Frostwhisper (5466), Krastinov's Bag of Horrors (5515), Of
# Love and Family (5848), Remember That I Love You (92415), Crest of Lordaeron
# (95189), Bloodied Insignia (95195), Abominable Creatures (95250).

